{"id":"level-up-2026-10-10","name":"2026-10-10 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1101","en":"The course has no formal requirement for previous design experience.","zh":"这门课并未正式要求学员具备设计经验。","note":"requirement · 需要， 需求， 要求； 需要的东西； 必要条件 · an entry requirement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1102","en":"Please give a specific example to support your argument.","zh":"请给出一个具体例子来支持你的论点。","note":"specific · 特定的； 明确的 · a specific example","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1103","en":"The estuary provides sheltered feeding grounds for many birds.","zh":"河口为许多鸟类提供了遮蔽良好的觅食地。","note":"estuary · 河口， 河口湾 · a river estuary","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1104","en":"The exhibition uses interactive displays to engage younger visitors.","zh":"展览通过互动展项吸引年幼游客参与。","note":"engage · 吸引； 占用； 使从事于， 使忙于； 雇用， 聘用； 与交战； 啮合， 衔接 · engage students","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1105","en":"She leaned closer to whisper the answer to her friend.","zh":"她凑近朋友，低声说出了答案。","note":"whisper · 低语 · whisper to someone","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1106","en":"The long walk gave us an appetite for dinner.","zh":"长时间步行让我们吃晚饭时胃口大开。","note":"appetite · 食欲， 胃口； 欲望 · a healthy appetite","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1107","en":"The team needs a clear strategy for attracting new volunteers.","zh":"团队需要一项吸引新志愿者的明确策略。","note":"strategy · 战略， 策略 · a clear strategy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1108","en":"The discussion began to revolve around the question of funding.","zh":"讨论开始围绕资金问题展开。","note":"revolve · 旋转 · revolve around","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1109","en":"The charity has a long-term plan to restore the wetlands.","zh":"慈善机构有一项修复湿地的长期计划。","note":"long-term · 长期的 · a long-term plan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1110","en":"The documentary shows how the animals mark their territory.","zh":"纪录片展示了这些动物如何标记领地。","note":"territory · 领土， 版图； 领域， 范围 · mark territory","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1111","en":"One clumsy movement sent the pile of books tumbling.","zh":"一个笨拙的动作让整摞书掉了下来。","note":"clumsy · 笨拙的； 不得体的 · a clumsy movement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1112","en":"The class explored inductive reasoning through a series of observations.","zh":"课堂通过一系列观察探讨了归纳推理。","note":"inductive · 诱导的， 归纳的 · inductive reasoning","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1113","en":"A tiny droplet clung to the tip of the leaf.","zh":"一小滴水挂在叶尖上。","note":"droplet · 小滴 · a water droplet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1114","en":"The workshop teaches volunteers how to maintain basic garden equipment.","zh":"工作坊教志愿者如何保养基础园艺设备。","note":"maintain · 维持， 保持； 维修， 保养； 坚持， 主张； 赡养， 负担 · maintain equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1115","en":"He works the evening shift at the railway station.","zh":"他在火车站上晚班。","note":"shift · 移动，转移；改变，转变；转换， 转变； 轮班 · a night shift","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1116","en":"The centre works to rehabilitate injured animals before releasing them.","zh":"中心致力于帮助受伤动物康复，再将其放归。","note":"rehabilitate · 改造， 使恢复正常生活； 使恢复原状， 修复； 复职； 恢复…的名誉 · rehabilitate injured animals","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1117","en":"The secondhand desk was a bargain at that price.","zh":"以那个价格买到这张二手书桌很划算。","note":"bargain · 讨价还价；协议； 交易； 便宜货 · a real bargain","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1118","en":"The exhibition benefited from advice given by a professional photographer.","zh":"展览受益于一位专业摄影师提供的建议。","note":"professional · 职业的；专业的；自由职业者； 专业人员 · professional advice","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1119","en":"The exhibition records the experiences of migrant workers in the city.","zh":"展览记录了这座城市中外来务工者的经历。","note":"migrant · 移居者， 移民； 迁移动物， 候鸟 · a migrant worker","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1120","en":"Residents were invited to contribute to the formulation of the plan.","zh":"居民受邀参与制定该计划。","note":"formulation · 公式化， 格式化； 确切的表达 · policy formulation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1121","en":"Her grandmother wore a pearl necklace to the celebration.","zh":"祖母戴着珍珠项链参加了庆典。","note":"pearl · 珍珠 · a pearl necklace","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1122","en":"The course will encompass drawing, photography, and basic printmaking.","zh":"这门课将涵盖绘画、摄影和基础版画制作。","note":"encompass · 包含； 包围； 环绕 · encompass several areas","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1123","en":"The documentary explores public transport in a rapidly growing megacity.","zh":"纪录片探讨了一座快速发展的巨型城市的公共交通。","note":"megacity · 大城市 · a growing megacity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1124","en":"The garden will remain open during the building repairs.","zh":"建筑维修期间，花园将保持开放。","note":"remain · 保持；仍旧是；剩下 · remain open","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1125","en":"The young musician's confidence continued to amaze the audience.","zh":"这位年轻音乐家的自信持续令观众惊叹。","note":"amaze · 使惊奇， 使惊愕 · amaze an audience","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1126","en":"We paid a small deposit to reserve the workshop space.","zh":"我们付了一小笔押金，预订工作坊场地。","note":"deposit · 存放；储蓄；使沉淀；付；存款； 保证金， 押金； 沉积物 · pay a deposit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1127","en":"The students poured the liquid into a clean glass flask.","zh":"学生们把液体倒入一个干净的玻璃烧瓶。","note":"flask · 长颈瓶； 烧瓶 · a glass flask","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1128","en":"The graph shows seasonal fluctuation in the number of visitors.","zh":"图表展示了游客数量的季节性波动。","note":"fluctuation · 波动， 起伏； 动摇 · seasonal fluctuation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1129","en":"The leather became more pliable after the craftsperson treated it.","zh":"经过工匠处理，皮革变得更柔韧。","note":"pliable · 容易受影响的； 顺从的； 易弯的， 柔韧的 · soft and pliable","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1130","en":"A sudden flash of light illuminated the distant clouds.","zh":"一道突如其来的闪光照亮了远处的云层。","note":"flash · 闪光，闪耀；闪烁； 闪光灯 · a flash of light","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1131","en":"The map traces trade routes across the African continent.","zh":"地图勾勒了穿越非洲大陆的贸易路线。","note":"continent · 大陆， 陆地； 洲 · the African continent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1132","en":"The guest room has a firm mattress and warm blankets.","zh":"客房配有结实的床垫和暖和的毯子。","note":"mattress · 床垫 · a firm mattress","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1133","en":"The diagram helps explain the complexity of the transport network.","zh":"图示有助于解释交通网络的复杂性。","note":"complexity · 复杂， 复杂性； 复杂的事物 · growing complexity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1134","en":"The caretaker asked visitors to avoid causing a disturbance.","zh":"管理员要求游客避免造成干扰。","note":"disturbance · 扰乱， 打扰； 骚乱， 混乱； 心神不安， 烦恼 · cause a disturbance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1135","en":"The festival offers simultaneous performances in three different courtyards.","zh":"节日在三个不同的庭院安排同时进行的演出。","note":"simultaneous · 同时的， 同时发生的， 同时存在的； 同步的 · simultaneous events","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1136","en":"The doors open automatically when visitors approach the entrance.","zh":"游客走近入口时，门会自动打开。","note":"automatically · 自动地； 无意识地 · open automatically","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1137","en":"Booking early does not guarantee a seat near the stage.","zh":"提前预订并不能保证坐到靠近舞台的位置。","note":"guarantee · 保证； · guarantee a place","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1138","en":"The librarian can recommend a book suited to your interests.","zh":"图书管理员能根据你的兴趣推荐一本书。","note":"recommend · 推荐； 劝告； 使受欢迎 · recommend a book","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1139","en":"A literal reading misses the humour in the poem.","zh":"逐字理解会错过这首诗中的幽默。","note":"literal · 照字面的； 逐字的 · a literal interpretation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1140","en":"The climbing roses began to entwine around the wooden arch.","zh":"攀缘玫瑰开始缠绕在木拱门上。","note":"entwine · 使缠住， 使盘绕 · entwine around","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1141","en":"The novel's indolent landlord leaves every task to his servants.","zh":"小说中懒惰的房东把每件事都交给仆人。","note":"indolent · 懒惰的， 倦怠的； 不活跃的， 无行动的 · an indolent character","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1142","en":"A helicopter flew above the coast during the afternoon.","zh":"下午，一架直升机在海岸上空飞过。","note":"helicopter · 直升飞机 · a rescue helicopter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1143","en":"Each workshop ticket includes a hot beverage during the break.","zh":"每张工作坊门票都包含休息时的一杯热饮。","note":"beverage · 饮料 · a hot beverage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1144","en":"She found the pottery class through an advertisement in the newspaper.","zh":"她通过报纸上的广告找到了这门陶艺课。","note":"advertisement · 广告， 公告； 广告活动， 宣传 · a newspaper advertisement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1145","en":"The stall sells ripe peaches picked earlier that morning.","zh":"摊位售卖当天早晨刚采摘的成熟桃子。","note":"ripe · 成熟的； 时机成熟的 · ripe fruit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1146","en":"Volunteers are the backbone of the community's annual arts festival.","zh":"志愿者是社区年度艺术节的支柱。","note":"backbone · 脊椎； 骨干； 支柱 · the backbone of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1147","en":"Driving through the storm seemed an insane idea to everyone.","zh":"大家都觉得开车穿过这场风暴是个荒唐的想法。","note":"insane · 蠢极的， 荒唐的； 精神病的， 精神失常的， 疯狂的 · an insane idea","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1148","en":"She tends to attribute her success to patient teachers.","zh":"她倾向于把自己的成功归功于耐心的老师。","note":"attribute · 把…归于['ætrIbjʊːt]；属性； 品质 · attribute success to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1149","en":"The mechanic examined the locking mechanism inside the damaged door.","zh":"机修工检查了损坏门内部的锁闭装置。","note":"mechanism · 机械装置； 机制， 机理； 办法 · a locking mechanism","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:s1150","en":"The biology course introduces genetic variation through examples from plants.","zh":"生物课程通过植物实例介绍遗传变异。","note":"genetic · 遗传的；[-s] 遗传学 · genetic variation","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:w1101","en":"requirement","zh":"需要， 需求， 要求； 需要的东西； 必要条件","note":"英 /rɪ'kwaɪəmənt/ · 美 /rɪ'kwaɪɚmənt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1101-uk-0c250f711662.mp3","text":"requirement"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1101-us-bdc8a8f1ac13.mp3","text":"requirement"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:w1102","en":"specific","zh":"特定的； 明确的","note":"英 /spə'sɪfɪk/ · 美 /spɪ'sɪfɪk/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1102-uk-246e2c134440.mp3","text":"specific"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1102-us-334b0093b88f.mp3","text":"specific"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-10:w1103","en":"estuary","zh":"河口， 河口湾","note":"英 /'estʃʊəri/ · 美 /'ɛstʃʊ'ɛri/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1103-uk-6b40563f2d6f.mp3","text":"estuary"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe